{
    "id": "EmergencyPlanWizard",
    "title": "Household Emergency Plan Builder",
    "description": "Guide the user through building a written emergency plan for their household.",
    "steps": [
        {
            "id": "household_profile",
            "prompt": "Tell me about your household composition.",
            "type": "form",
            "fields": [
                {
                    "name": "adults",
                    "label": "Number of Adults",
                    "type": "number",
                    "default": 2
                },
                {
                    "name": "children",
                    "label": "Number of Children",
                    "type": "number",
                    "default": 0
                },
                {
                    "name": "elderly",
                    "label": "Number of Elderly/Mobility Limited",
                    "type": "number",
                    "default": 0
                },
                {
                    "name": "pets",
                    "label": "Number of Pets",
                    "type": "number",
                    "default": 0
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "special_needs",
            "prompt": "Are there specific needs we should plan for?",
            "type": "multi-select",
            "options": [
                {
                    "label": "Inuslin/Refrigerated Meds",
                    "value": "meds_cold"
                },
                {
                    "label": "Mobility Issues (Stairs difficult)",
                    "value": "mobility"
                },
                {
                    "label": "Infants (Formula/Diapers)",
                    "value": "infant"
                },
                {
                    "label": "Sensory/Autism Spectrum",
                    "value": "sensory"
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "hazards",
            "prompt": "What are the primary threats in your region?",
            "type": "multi-select",
            "options": [
                {
                    "label": "Winter Storm / Extreme Cold",
                    "value": "winter"
                },
                {
                    "label": "Summer Heat / Grid Failure",
                    "value": "summer"
                },
                {
                    "label": "Hurricane / Flooding",
                    "value": "flood"
                },
                {
                    "label": "Wildfire",
                    "value": "fire"
                },
                {
                    "label": "Civil Unrest / Supply Chain",
                    "value": "civil"
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "comms_plan",
            "prompt": "Let's establish a Communications Plan.",
            "type": "form",
            "fields": [
                {
                    "name": "out_of_area_contact",
                    "label": "Out-of-Area Contact Name",
                    "type": "text",
                    "placeholder": "Aunt Jane in Ohio"
                },
                {
                    "name": "out_of_area_phone",
                    "label": "Phone Number",
                    "type": "tel"
                },
                {
                    "name": "meeting_place_near",
                    "label": "Meeting Place (Neighborhood)",
                    "type": "text",
                    "placeholder": "The Big Oak Tree"
                },
                {
                    "name": "meeting_place_far",
                    "label": "Meeting Place (Out of Town)",
                    "type": "text",
                    "placeholder": "Library in Next Town"
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "utility_shutoff",
            "prompt": "Can you locate and operate your utility shutoffs?",
            "type": "checklist",
            "options": [
                {
                    "label": "I know where the Main Water Value is.",
                    "value": "know_water"
                },
                {
                    "label": "I have a tool to shut off Gas (Wrench).",
                    "value": "know_gas"
                },
                {
                    "label": "I know which breaker controls the furnace.",
                    "value": "know_electric"
                }
            ]
        }
    ],
    "outputs": [
        {
            "type": "markdown_plan",
            "template": "# Emergency Plan for {{household_profile.adults}} Adults, {{household_profile.children}} Kids\n\n## 1. Household Profile\n- **Special Considerations:** {{special_needs}}\n- **Primary Threats:** {{hazards}}\n\n## 2. Communications\n- **Out-of-Area Contact:** {{comms_plan.out_of_area_contact}} ({{comms_plan.out_of_area_phone}})\n- **Rally Point (Near):** {{comms_plan.meeting_place_near}}\n- **Rally Point (Far):** {{comms_plan.meeting_place_far}}\n\n## 3. Action Items\n{{#if utility_shutoff.know_gas}}\n- [x] Gas Shutoff Tool Acquired\n{{else}}\n- [ ] **URGENT:** Buy a non-sparking wrench for gas shutoff.\n{{/if}}\n\n## 4. Next Steps\n- Review `Module 15.6` for Mobility Plans if applicable.\n- Review `Module 14.3` for Child/Elderly specifics.",
            "includes_checklists": true
        }
    ]
}